			<zone xml:id="p4z7-0" points="1795,1825 1806,1829 1813,1822 1851,1815 1861,1815 1867,1821 1876,1821 1876,1797 1867,1799 1859,1792 1852,1798 1848,1794 1831,1792 1828,1788 1822,1792 1816,1787 1804,1795 1795,1795">1802,1811 1827,1811 1853,1811 1879,1811</zone>
